[{"title":"在东园柬毛稚黄","author":"恽格","text":"海云茫茫春霰断，柳丝绿遍寒江岸。\n细网幽窗竹烟乱，山桃海棠落将半。\n鸟声过残雨，兰风细吹案。\n我思在空谷，我梦属云汉。\n衔璧只独照，锦衾空宵烂。\n飞花濛濛还坐叹，江郎藻笔不在腕。\n石泉水芹泛溪馆，柳下无人待谁锻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6879,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山楼曲","author":"恽格","text":"空楼蔽芳树，竹叶落翠羽。\n瑟瑟琅玕满楼雾，青青楼上山无数。\n湖风吹山山作云，湿云含雨连山度。\n我思飘渺云中君，乃在十二峰间汉皋路。\n贻我瑶华双珠佩，流光洒洒空灵遇。\n金银台冷芙蓉衣，弱水如烟散霞圃。\n星飞井底海水乾，去天一角望蛇盘。\n手绾罗襦非合欢，雌龙怨涩冰弦弹。\n绡文乱染红兰珊，娇花泣露金井寒。\n辘轳声转烟萝坞，梦送春云过江浦。\n天鸡唤梦云不知，满楼湿尽山楼雨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6880,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初冬过荆溪访潘元白便移舟西氿从南山一带看枫叶同游为天台石枚吉月陵友云元白髯浮屠","author":"恽格","text":"我从兰陵来，呼友荆溪市。\n荆溪主人爱看山，牵船脱帽西风里。\n千林十月不见霜，平堤碧草浮鱼梁。\n芦花冥冥水浅浅，杨叶索索烟苍苍。\n潘子挥长笺，篷底坐焚香。\n四座分酡酥，倾杯无酒浆。\n江东步兵自行炙，邺下才子调银簧。\n舍棹入翠微，扶石憩山馆。\n石林崩滩路不同，高松无人鸟相唤。\n前坂穿稻畦，樵径忽下断。\n古藤摇寒柯，红桕落将半。\n榆风柽露变殷紫，杉阴桧枝翠交乱。\n几时饭黄精，直上铜山颠。\n一为鸾凤音，万壑皆泠然。\n日夕下兰坡，高歌齐扣舷。\n手拂冠缨弄鱼鸟，葭汀空影相澄鲜。\n渔网冲烟沙岸直，水光尽作明霞色。\n回看松路起昏鸦，云暗山门众山黑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6881,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"孤山远眺 其一","author":"恽格","text":"振衣空翠里，怅望水天隈。\n百谷秋涛壮，千帆夕照来。\n竹深山径合，云尽海门开。\n无限登临意，忧时赋《七哀》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6882,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"孤山远眺 其二","author":"恽格","text":"一峰原砥柱，今日见桑田。\n孤山原在江中，属泰兴，今成平陆，为骥江所有。\n海峤云边出，江城树杪悬。\n叶飞孤岸雨，雁度万家烟。\n吴楚苍茫里，凭高思渺然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6883,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江城","author":"恽格","text":"秋风杨柳渡，马首散秋声。\n万雉云连水，三江雨洗兵。\n楼台横战垒，箫鼓动严城。\n未见爰居下，波涛夜不惊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6884,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄范荆门","author":"恽格","text":"白马雕弓玉辘轳，荆门专阃握铜符。\n虎牙吹角翻新垒，鱼腹披云按旧图。\n月满三巴歌出塞，秋高千骑猎平芜。\n轻裘傥过衡阳路，好遣双鸿到五湖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6885,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柴墟怀古","author":"恽格","text":"金牌旧恨泣鲛绡，江岸荒祠尚寂寥。\n自昔河山征战地，至今风雨鬼神朝。\n涛翻白马东来急，天接黄龙北望遥。\n极目寒烟凭吊处，长虹中夜出云霄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6886,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"王颛庵太史拙修堂宴集分韵时移家还里将有远游留别娄中诸君子","author":"恽格","text":"花残江馆滞征缨，绿浦红潮柳岸平。\n芳草有心抽夜雨，东风无力转春晴。\n艰难抱子还乡国，落拓浮家仗友生。\n只为踌躇千里别，归期临发又重更。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6887,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同李非夏湖山眺望 其一","author":"恽格","text":"春愁正满落花天，不见王孙又几年。\n添得湖山今日泪，玉箫吹断鹧鸪烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6888,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同李非夏湖山眺望 其二","author":"恽格","text":"旧梦湖南春雨空，高歌无地望崆峒。\n囊中自有江山在，乱采莺花入变风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6889,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同李非夏湖山眺望 其三","author":"恽格","text":"白马江潮自往还，鸱夷旧恨满吴关。\n可怜都作啼鹃血，红遍西湖梦里山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6890,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同李非夏湖山眺望 其四","author":"恽格","text":"天地容吾未老身，烟云不改旧时贫。\n西湖四月无游女，独采蘋花待故人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6891,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海昌东门望海 其一","author":"恽格","text":"海老神蛟入夜哀，观涛曾见水云开。\n奔雷欲散连鳌雪，一线横空白练来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6892,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海昌东门望海 其二","author":"恽格","text":"海气苍茫冷罽袍，几看明月蜃楼高。\n可怜精卫当年影，片石犹悬大海涛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6893,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题杨柳 其一","author":"恽格","text":"何处香车紫陌尘，枝枝斜堕落花津。\n美人独立东风里，半为春愁翠黛颦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6894,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题杨柳 其二","author":"恽格","text":"乌啼江月正昏黄，风袅残烟翠带长。\n最是笛中听不得，白门花落旧宫墙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6895,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题杨柳 其三","author":"恽格","text":"弱缕风前未送寒，和烟和雨上阑干。\n当年歌舞消魂地，深院沈沈独自看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6896,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题杨柳 其四","author":"恽格","text":"莫为春愁减带围，风前弱缕尚依依。\n伤心最是红桥路，宝马钿车乱后稀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6897,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题杨柳 其五","author":"恽格","text":"绿池花片晓来增，欲挽东风力不胜。\n只为送春无几日，自将烟翠染溪藤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6898,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题杨柳 其六","author":"恽格","text":"数点昏烟月一潭，绿阴桑火过春蚕。\n从今移入图中看，不必攀条忆汉南。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6899,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题杨柳 其七","author":"恽格","text":"灞岸千丝定有无，隋河旧绿已全芜。\n抽毫细染眠烟势，兵气应难到画图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6900,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题杨柳 其八","author":"恽格","text":"梦隔春云海路长，杨花飞尽莫思乡。\n闽南不是无青柳，海国遥闻已种桑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6901,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"短歌行","author":"杨宗发","text":"有酒当歌，歌亦莫苦。\n来日如归，曾不俟我。\n牙须䰄䰄，积水生苔。\n苔生水枯，使我心哀。\n青天为舟，日月为桨。\n渡我百年，他人嗣往。\n蜉蝣匪短，嵩岳匪长。\n人悲有余，我乐未央。\n何用为乐，与彼婴儿。\n仰视苍苍，生不自知。\n何用为乐？\n与彼草木。\n蒙蒙尔心，俾无饥渴。\n何用为乐？\n与彼山阳。\n朝行九州，夕不遗光。\n何用为乐？\n与彼瓦石。\n中无肺肠，饮食不得。\n何用为乐？\n与彼浮云。\n逢逢天飞，首尾无因。\n何用为乐？\n与彼流水。\n出入鱼腹，长生无死。\n生死同寄，形影俱虚。\n但当欢乐，终我须臾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6902,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山中诗 其一","author":"杨宗发","text":"寝兴绝思患，夙昔憩夷简。\n闲闲系林壑，湜湜嗜苔藓。\n即目穷所变，因心去其褊。\n和风芬以集，灵鸟声相啭。\n暇逸通左右，谈笑承深浅。\n春光既斯日，遇物平生见。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6903,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山中诗 其二","author":"杨宗发","text":"空岩怅流目，虚壑驰超忽。\n物色宕烟外，予怀澹川末。\n闲时夜气发，静地春光接。\n木石叩情性，见闻冥欣戚。\n青苔积鸟爱，绝径断云迹。\n旷览识初古，周旋任天质。\n神凝不我昧，理永奚所隔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6904,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山中诗 其三","author":"杨宗发","text":"佳兴挟晨夕，气候亦余好。\n春色散容与，朝光聚窈窕。\n新烟入女萝，宿雨出青草。\n未敢测神化，殊知待林鸟。\n索居共樵爨，纳拙将渔筱。\n登涉中有源，岩崖外为兆。\n遇始识俱殄，感终神与杳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6905,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"野蔓","author":"潘高","text":"野蔓不缘树，空引枝叶长。\n溪谷少人民，猛虎啼河梁。\n虎饥不择肉，夜盗豕与羊。\n有客来何为，夜行多苦伤。\n门外追呼急，子归皆仓皇。\n庐舍无遗粟，赍我诸军粮。\n军粮几十万，朽腐委风霜。\n诸军何所事，戈雁以翱翔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6906,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题秋江归棹图","author":"潘高","text":"枫叶潇潇柿叶稀，空江白浪拍长堤。\n逆风小橹愁无力，家在黄陵西更西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6907,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"漫兴","author":"潘高","text":"三月仓庚五月蝉，寒蛩八月复凄然。\n只摊残卷溪边坐，把笔题诗过一年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6908,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂兴 其一","author":"潘高","text":"明月函关路，清风华岳祠。\n十年身不到，一夜梦犹随。\n冰坼河声远，花开日色迟。\n何时乘小蹇，寻我旧题诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6909,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日杂兴 其二","author":"潘高","text":"门前乌桕树，树底一人行。\n苦爱清秋色，闲听伐木声。\n风吹寒雾散，日射午岚轻。\n谁识悠悠者，幽居不用名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6910,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春归","author":"潘高","text":"不识春从何处归，空余春酒渍人衣。\n墙腰日色投西下，风脚杨花带北飞。\n筋力自知垂老异，欢娱偏恨故人稀。\n凭高望远情何极，独坐吟诗卧翠微。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6911,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卖花词","author":"潘高","text":"身是城边卖花叟，卖花归来即买酒。\n曲巷朱门声婉转，春风作伴蜂声满。\n家家有花花未开，春风先到我家来。\n劝君买花须少年，劝君莫惜买花钱。\n卖花老叟年年在，买花年年时时改。\n昨日少年今日老，君不见担上花开可常好。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6912,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠别","author":"潘高","text":"襆被萧条落照前，江湖飘泊又经年。\n云深禹穴寻山屐，雪合耶溪载酒船。\n醉后可遭官长骂，镜中知有故人怜。\n匆匆更别关门去，空对椒盘颂远天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6913,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题秦淮晓渡图","author":"潘高","text":"潮上扉平水，乌啼月满街。\n一声桡响处，晓梦落秦淮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6914,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杪秋漫兴","author":"潘高","text":"独立枫林古道旁，参差烟霭护芳塘。\n有时蹑屩寻幽草，一向开门背夕阳。\n山色青葱供竹杖，酒情缥缈记渔庄。\n谁人更惬沧洲兴，捩柁天南问石梁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6915,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"无题","author":"潘高","text":"飞燕当年事已非，汉家庭院思依依。\n多情只有樊通德，拥髻镫前泪湿衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6916,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"余欲北行邻翁持酒相饯戏题一绝","author":"潘高","text":"轻云疏雨变新凉，白酒黄鸡饯旧庄。\n自笑明朝千里别，堆盘赤枣作重阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6917,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别庄氏女子","author":"潘高","text":"忆我种梅日，甲午暮春间。\n生尔十月后，梅花始及肩。\n女长梅亦大，于今二十年。\n今尔别我去，梅花仍满檐。\n与尔簪荆钗，摘梅插花钿。\n凄然与母别，母痛泪如泉。\n拭汝纵横泪，记我临歧言。\n尔在汝舅侧，实如父母前。\n汝姑既已无，正须赖汝贤。\n其余诸姑叔，和柔实所先。\n苦语何可尽，绕梅空潸然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6918,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晋陵喜闻于子遂庵归里却寄十二韵","author":"潘高","text":"八月风露清，林端枣红皱。\n喜我故人归，归与穷昏昼。\n离绪依僮仆，欢情隔老幼。\n如此二十年，思之令人瘦。\n似我客京华，卖文救颠仆。\n官长怕逢迎，溪田忆耕耨。\n悠悠寄征旆，披披拂归袖。\n及来故山边，壶榼争相就。\n懒说短长亭，梦惊东西堠。\n翻思君在远，岁月荒难究。\n去者松楸古，来者年齿茂。\n君犹住燕山，缥缈亲句读。\n如今事已然，志愿颇稍售。\n出入有儿郎，孙亦复娟秀。\n茗碗列前轩，炉香置几右。\n主客醵钱刀，亲朋罗饤饾。\n笑语多旧事，契阔喜新觏。\n时杂往来客，中有草木臭。\n是时江南天，烟雨寒橘柚。\n明当少有携，一醉为君寿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6919,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苦雨行","author":"潘高","text":"泥滑泥滑傍篱落，补屋补屋呼屋角。\n复有菰蒲深更深，村边尽日啼姑恶。\n风雨无赖送春归，江北江南水半扉。\n黄笠青蓑乘棹去，萋萋草长没渔矶。\n此时合闭茅堂坐，何堪更鼓他乡柁。\n四月沿溜下阊门，云连山顶烟护村。\n东风卷浪轻帆健，过尽千峰酒一樽。\n及抵家山更萧索，雨亦不收风又作。\n何时巷陌听啼莺，一洗从前唤雨声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6920,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"潘高","text":"杏花风起雨如丝，人在轻寒暮阁时。\n杨柳毵毵春院闭，青鸠啼上最高枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6921,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿韬光望海日","author":"毛先舒","text":"龙宫鹫岭天下奇，韬光更上升云梯。\n苍穹仿佛欲摩顶，石气濛濛拂衣冷。\n山僧邀我山中宿，乘兴扶筇踏岩谷。\n便因晞发卧峰头，俯听檐铃和风竹。\n夜深月没静群籁，隔树明河似萦带。\n须臾微红乍起灭，曈昽正出扶桑外。\n天浮海潏见俄顷，不觉此身驻西岭。\n谁持青镜写燕支，闪烁团圞无定影。\n沧波一半吹紫涛，良久不见东方高。\n凌风欲去更惆怅，天水茫茫两摇漾。\n绀殿红楼黯欲开，下方始听鸡三唱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6922,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"毛先舒","text":"今夕是何夕，碧云沧海端。\n月华如梦醒，秋色到烟寒。\n帝女量河水，宫人裂扇纨。\n愁心满空碧，只倚玉阑干。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6923,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋色","author":"毛先舒","text":"秋色满吴岭，登高四望同。\n断虹垂木末，残雨过江东。\n细草还留碧，寒花也自红。\n昔人高卧处，应在白云中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6924,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"祁奕远至钱塘","author":"毛先舒","text":"一水中分越岸沙，春鸿消息路偏赊。\n别来何处搴芳杜，相见依然感鬓华。\n阮籍垆边堪避世，王尼车上便为家。\n对君却掩三年泪，苦竹城头起暮笳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6925,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吴宫词","author":"毛先舒","text":"苏台月冷夜乌栖，饮罢吴王醉似泥。\n别有深恩酬不得，向君歌舞背君啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6926,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟白香山有木诗 其一","author":"倪涛","text":"有木名梧桐，栖凤临清池。\n朝阳承新色，碧玉拂疏枝。\n春风及万物，枝叶方荄滋。\n别类或刺手，花发眩赪姿。\n浮华惜无实，讹似空参差。\n排云高百尺，孤立耀后时。\n知音傥可待，《韶》《雅》夸天资。\n槃阿厉名节，澍雨敷丹墀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6927,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟白香山有木诗 其二","author":"倪涛","text":"有木盛湖湘，其名赋束楚。\n同在新蒸中，独以翘楚许。\n丛生浸以滋，藩触势莫阻。\n托质非无用，横生未得所。\n偏不侪梓枌，翻忧害禾黍。\n或慕坚强性，相依近居处。\n下趋棘与荆，当路苦徒侣。\n山樵不可刈，聚类快一炬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6928,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"凤城客兴","author":"董玚","text":"迎晖山下此来游，草草逢人易唱酬。\n处士失时存意气，孤臣去国见风流。\n江湖自拟同浮梗，身世相看恋古丘。\n念有对床兄弟好，花台摇落独居幽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6929,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送同学还建业兼呈其伯兄及陈元孝","author":"董玚","text":"见君无几值君行，惜别因思君弟兄。\n五岭烟云轻载去，六朝风雅旧宗盟。\n香过野岸花分候，路出江皋鸟变声。\n到日若逢陈大在，道余将出赵陀城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6930,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宝月台次憨山老人梦游集韵 其一","author":"董玚","text":"孤城此地几兵戈，剩水残山近若何。\n谁唱《满江红》一阕，斜阳低处晚霞多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6931,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宝月台次憨山老人梦游集韵 其二","author":"董玚","text":"暮山万叠翠烟含，此夕登楼意渺然。\n兀坐四更方吐月，有人松下唤渔船。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6932,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄雀谣","author":"吴屯侯","text":"八月黄雀生，九月黄雀飞。\n飞来飞去啄禾黍，禾黍欲空黄雀肥。\n原头网罗日相逐，嗟汝身肥命亦速。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6933,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"相逢行赠范阳李都护","author":"吴屯侯","text":"昨朝相逢在狭路，死生一言不相顾。\n今朝相逢都市中，挥鞭掉首去若风。\n朱家剧孟世罕有，敦盘三物俱成空。\n夫君慷慨燕南客，珠袍锦带何翕赫。\n床头莫邪中夜鸣，睥睨泰山轻一掷。\n相逢不语心自知，倾盖已作千秋期。\n荆卿不得鲁句践，易水衣冠徒尔为。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6934,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江头哭","author":"吴屯侯","text":"江头夜哭声呜呜，乡音仿佛越与吴。\n更闻醉骂哭随止，从此竟夜惟呼卢。\n市门早开群妇走，白棓驱阿似雷吼。\n叱使沿街索酒钱，泪珠簌簌擎纤手。\n自言生长深闺房，谁知万里投边疆。\n缠身铁械死不得，羞颜无处堪遮藏。\n罪人之孥尽应殪，皇恩宥减等天地。\n男儿屠裂有余辜，那许蛾眉言节义。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6935,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泊舟江浒","author":"吴屯侯","text":"空江微月落，不寐露沾衣。\n独鹳当矶立，繁萤贴水飞。\n客怀秋更远，身计老多违。\n自愧非袁虎，高吟听者稀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6936,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟泊龙江","author":"吴屯侯","text":"飘泊终何事，征帆日趁流。\n鸟飞江驿暮，人到石城秋。\n市火浮孤棹，渔歌出远洲。\n停沽休借问，长记柳边楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6937,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吴门送汾阳刘明府往宣州旧治","author":"吴屯侯","text":"宦迹君何滞，他乡且作归。\n兵荒征路险，贫病别人稀。\n晚驿兼云宿，秋帆带叶飞。\n南陵旧山色，应待谢玄晖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6938,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自遣","author":"吴屯侯","text":"敝刺虽怀总未投，早知身世一轻沤。\n长贫枉说千金赋，高卧犹存百尺楼。\n已谢子鱼分讲席，还嗟夷甫覆神州。\n绕门秋水菰蒲满，若问新盟有数鸥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6939,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"酬郭万户远寄塞下","author":"吴屯侯","text":"万里关山万里风，手磨残血试彫弓。\n苍驼晚放吹螺甲，黄鼠朝烹灌马?。\n谁说王嫱长有恨，不知苏武是何功。\n闻君一事犹堪羡，毳帐胭脂比旧红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":6940,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]